# Kubernets definitions

## Kubernetes

kubernetes is an open source platform that automates the deployment, scale and managment of containerized applications.

## k3s

k3s is a lightweight and minimale version of kubernetes (use fewer resources)

## Controle Plane

the controle plane is the central component of k8s that responsible for maintaining resources of the cluster

## Cluster

Cluster is a one or more nodes that work together to run containerized applications


## Node

node is refer to an individual machine **(physical or virtual)** that is part of a cluster and runs containerized applications